description: "Architecture boundaries for the Next.js + Supabase Fat Bear Week app."
globs:
  - "web/app/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
  - "web/components/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
  - "web/lib/**/*.{ts,tsx}"
alwaysApply: false
---

# Architecture

- Layers: `app` routes → components → `lib` helpers → Supabase
- Prefer Server Components; `'use client'` only when needed
- Generic tournament model (rounds/matchups); no hardcoded field sizes
- Service role only on server; invite-only access
- See `docs/ARCHITECTURE.md`
